content.text:
With the mock API, the v2 work-orders endpoint only accepts the brake inspection (`insp-7c2e-2201`). The coupler inspection (`insp-7c2e-2203`) was successfully created for loco-4419, but v2 work-order creation consistently returns 422 for it. The only work order that can be opened in this flow is via the deprecated v1 endpoint.

```json
{
  "work_order_id": "wo-legacy-0001"
}
```
